327
00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:00.890
<v Speaker 2>Who is Allah?

328
00:31:02.250 --> 00:31:04.890
<v Speaker 2>He is Malik and He is Sayyid, right?

329
00:31:05.130 --> 00:31:13.930
<v Speaker 2>He is our absolute owner with complete authority over us, which makes us His milqiya, His property.

330
00:31:18.650 --> 00:31:19.210
<v Speaker 2>You see that?

331
00:31:20.090 --> 00:31:47.850
<v Speaker 2>he is the shepherd we are the sheep but Allah as Rabb is an owner who not only takes good care of his property who not only has complete authority and control over it who not only ensures its growth to maturity with love, kindness, concern who not only looks after it, protects it

332
00:31:48.490 --> 00:32:00.970
<v Speaker 2>sustains it, puts it on the right path but then on top of all of that he bestows numerous undeserving generous gifts upon it.

