336
00:32:24.570 --> 00:32:25.930
<v Speaker 2>No, He is Malik.

337
00:32:26.410 --> 00:32:27.570
<v Speaker 2>He is Al-Malik.

338
00:32:27.570 --> 00:32:28.290
<v Speaker 2>He is As-Sayyad.

339
00:32:29.050 --> 00:32:30.970
<v Speaker 2>He doesn't need to do anything for us.

340
00:32:32.090 --> 00:32:33.770
<v Speaker 2>He does not owe us anything.

341
00:32:35.210 --> 00:32:39.610
<v Speaker 2>Therefore anything and everything he gives us, it has to be a gift.

342
00:32:41.610 --> 00:32:44.810
<v Speaker 2>He is not obligated to give us anything.

343
00:32:48.410 --> 00:32:51.610
<v Speaker 2>I did not do anything to deserve my eyesight.

344
00:32:53.850 --> 00:32:56.490
<v Speaker 2>I did not do anything to pay for my hands.

345
00:32:59.690 --> 00:33:03.050
