346
00:33:03.450 --> 00:33:04.330
<v Speaker 2>Forget both eyes.

347
00:33:04.410 --> 00:33:06.490
<v Speaker 2>How much would you sell me one eye for?

348
00:33:09.850 --> 00:33:12.250
<v Speaker 2>How much would you sell your hands for?

349
00:33:15.930 --> 00:33:18.970
<v Speaker 2>How much is your ability to walk worth to you?

350
00:33:21.210 --> 00:33:23.170
<v Speaker 2>We just cannot put a price on these things.

351
00:33:23.210 --> 00:33:25.050
<v Speaker 2>These are priceless gifts.

352
00:33:27.370 --> 00:33:33.610
<v Speaker 2>So Allah gave us all these precious gifts but He did not just give them to us.

